{"id":"P057-1","subject":"P","unit":"P057","unitTitle":"2024 하반기 · 24.10.05 한국남부발전 (사람인)","set":1,"questions":[{"id":"P057-S1-Q01","number":1,"question":"24.10.05 한국남부발전 (사람인) · 객관식 1번","searchText":" 01\n\n다음 조건에 대한 송전단 전압V은?\n\n ⦁수전단 전압  : 120V   ⦁부하전류 0.1A \n\n ⦁부하역률 0.8       ⦁선로 저항 15Ω\n\n ⦁선로 리액턴스 20Ω\n\n\n①     ② \n③     ④ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 한국남부발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e16-m01","number":1},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e16-m01-q.webp","width":678,"height":697},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e16-m01-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1242}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P057-S1-Q02","number":2,"question":"24.10.05 한국남부발전 (사람인) · 객관식 2번","searchText":" 02\n\n다음 내용의 빈칸에 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n     가공전선로는 (      )가 커야한다.\n\n\n\n① 도전율        ② 비중\n\n③ 내구성        ④ 기계적 강도","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 한국남부발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e16-m02","number":2},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e16-m02-q.webp","width":678,"height":606},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e16-m02-e1.webp","width":696,"height":643}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P057-S1-Q03","number":3,"question":"24.10.05 한국남부발전 (사람인) · 객관식 3번","searchText":" 03\n\n전력용 콘덴서와 비교할 때, 동기조상기가 가지는 이점은\n\n무엇인가?\n\n\n① 증설 및 보수가 용이하다.\n\n② 전력손실이 상대적으로 매우 작다.\n\n③ 가격이 저렴하며, 불연속적인 조정을 할 수 있다.\n\n④ 진상 외에 지상 무효전력의 공급이 가능하다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 한국남부발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e16-m03","number":3},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e16-m03-q.webp","width":678,"height":451},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e16-m03-e1.webp","width":696,"height":783}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P057-S1-Q04","number":4,"question":"24.10.05 한국남부발전 (사람인) · 객관식 4번","searchText":" 04\n\n정격전압이 66kV, 부하전류가 220A, 퍼센트\n\n임피던스가 10인 교류발전기의 동기 임피던스\n\nΩ는?\n\n①           ② \n③           ④ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 한국남부발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e16-m04","number":4},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e16-m04-q.webp","width":696,"height":609},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e16-m04-e1.webp","width":696,"height":430}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P057-S1-Q05","number":5,"question":"24.10.05 한국남부발전 (사람인) · 객관식 5번","searchText":" 05\n\n이며, 0이 아닌 상태인 경우는 어떤 고장이\n\n발생한 경우인가?\n\n\n① 1선 지락고장     ② 3상 단락고장\n\n③ 2선 지락고장     ④ 선간 단락고장","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 한국남부발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e16-m05","number":5},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e16-m05-q.webp","width":696,"height":568},"explanationImages":[{"src":"dat