2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P057-S1-Q08","number":8,"question":"24.10.05 한국남부발전 (사람인) · 객관식 8번","searchText":" 08\n\n전자 유도장해를 줄이기 위한 대책으로 옳은 것은?\n\n   ㉠ 전력선과 통신선을 직각으로 설치한다.\n\n   ㉡ 전력선을 지중전선로로 설치한다.\n\n   ㉢ 나전선을 이용하여 전선로를 구성한다.\n\n   ㉣ 전선과 통신선 사이의 거리를 최소화한다.\n\n① ㉠, ㉡        ② ㉠, ㉢\n\n③ ㉡, ㉢        ④ ㉢, ㉣","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 한국남부발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e16-m08","number":8},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e16-m08-q.webp","width":678,"height":678},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e16-m08-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1480}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P057-S1-Q09","number":9,"question":"24.10.05 한국남부발전 (사람인) · 객관식 9번","searchText":" 09\n\n직류 타여자 발전기의 회전속도를 2500rpm에서 500\n\nrpm으로 변경하는 경우, 기전력은 기존의 몇 배가 되는\n\n가? (단, 기타 조건은 무시한다.)\n\n\n                           \n①            ②  \n\n                            \n③            ④ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 한국남부발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e16-m09","number":9},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e16-m09-q.webp","width":678,"height":562},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e16-m09-e1.webp","width":678,"height":402}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P057-S1-Q10","number":10,"question":"24.10.05 한국남부발전 (사람인) · 객관식 10번","searchText":" 10\n\n무부하 분권 발전기의 계자저항이 50Ω, 계자전류가\n\n2A, 전기자 저항이 2Ω일 때, 유기 기전력V은?\n\n\n① 102         ② 104\n\n③ 108         ④ 116","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 한국남부발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e16-m10","number":10},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e16-m10-q.webp","width":696,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e16-m10-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P057-S1-Q11","number":11,"question":"24.10.05 한국남부발전 (사람인) · 객관식 11번","searchText":" 11\n\n3상 동기 발전기의 여자전류 2A 에 대한 유기 기전력이\n\n300V, 3상 단락전류가 15A인 경우, 동기 임피던스는\n\n몇 Ω인가?\n\n\n① 5           ② 10\n\n③ 15          ④ 20","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 한국남부발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e16-m11","number":11},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e16-m11-q.webp","width":696,"height":683},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e16-m11-e1.webp","width":678,"height":555}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P057-S1-Q12","number":12,"question":"24.10.05 한국남부발전 (사람인) · 객관식 12번","searchText":" 12\n\n자기여자현상을 방지하기 위한 방법으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 단락비가 큰 발전기를 사용한다.\n\n② 발전기 2대를 병렬로 운전한다.\n\n③ 수전단에 리액터를 병렬로 접속한다.\n\n④ 조상기를 과여자로 운전한다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 한국남부발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e16-m12","number":12},"qu